---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <Fragment slot="header" />

  <Hero2
    variant="overlay"
    overlapHeader={false}
    title="Don't age<br />quietly."
    subtitle="The interventions with the strongest evidence in longevity medicine are also the cheapest — and almost nobody does them, because there is nothing to sell. Start by finding out where you actually stand. Then fill the first bucket. Everything else can wait its turn."
    actions={[
      { variant: 'primary', text: PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL, href: '/contact' },
      { variant: 'ghost', text: 'How aging works', href: '/#how-aging-works' },
    ]}
    image={{
      ...heroHome,
      alt: 'A person standing on a rocky ridge with arms open toward a stormy sky',
    }}
  >
    <Header
      slot="nav"
      embedded
      isSticky={false}
      links={header.links}
      actions={header.actions}
    />
    <Fragment slot="content">
      96 questions. About ten minutes. Free, and nothing you enter is sent anywhere.
    </Fragment>
  </Hero2>

  <HowAgingWorks />

  <EverythingPeaks
    id="why-urgent"
    eyebrow="Why any of this is urgent"
    headingHtml="Everything peaks.<br />Then it <span class='text-accent'>slopes.</span>"
    cta={{ text: 'Understand the model', href: '/contact' }}
  >
    <Fragment slot="body">
      <Text>
        Every system in your body rises to a peak, then declines at some rate, and
        somewhere below there is a floor — not a number, an event. A fall and a broken
        hip. Dialysis. Oxygen. A heart attack.
      </Text>
      <Text class="mt-[1lh]">
        The distance between where you are now and that floor is your reserve. It is
        measurable, it differs wildly between your own systems, and you almost certainly
        don't know any of yours.
      </Text>
    </Fragment>
    <!-- image slot uses default grey placeholder until asset is ready -->
    <img
      slot="image"
      src={whyUrgentImg.src}
      width={whyUrgentImg.width}
      height={whyUrgentImg.height}
      alt="Chart showing how organ function peaks then declines with age, with managed vs unmanaged trajectories"
      class="w-full rounded-[32px] object-cover"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
  </EverythingPeaks>

  <TextSplit
    id="accept-and-change"
    eyebrow="Accept, and change"
    heading="Half of this is not your problem."
  >
    <Text>
      Your eyes are going to stiffen. You will lose distance vision. You can eat perfectly
      and train like an athlete and it will happen anyway — so accept it, and stop spending
      worry on it.
    </Text>
    <Text class="mt-[1.3em]">
      Your kidney function falling because your blood pressure and blood sugar are
      unmanaged is not the same thing at all. It is silent, it is doing damage you cannot
      feel, and it is entirely changeable.
    </Text>
    <Text class="mt-[1.3em]">
      <strong class="font-bold text-default">The wisdom to know the difference is the whole product.</strong>
      {' '}
      <a href="/how-aging-works" class="font-bold text-accent underline decoration-solid underline-offset-2">What's fixed, what isn't.</a>
    </Text>
  </TextSplit>

